  more
lazy

x[^n]
.
<p>x<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes">
<hr>
<ol>
<li id="fn1">
<p>note</p>
<p>more
lazy<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink">↩︎</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
````

